<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Jönsson et al. (2006) & Smith et al. (2006) up-the-gradient PIN1 polarization and polar auxin transport model for shoot apical meristem phyllotaxis — MorphoEval overall 53.3/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `2006-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem.py` (weighted score: 53.8/100). The Pass 1 baseline script implements only a 32-cell 1D periodic ring without a 2D cellular L1 meristem dome topology, radial growth advection and primordial auxin depletion sinks, dispersion-relation eigenvalue verification, transitions across the 4 phyllotactic regimes (spiral 137.5 deg, distichous 180 deg, decussate 90 deg, tricussate 120 deg), NPA/pin1 pharmacological block and exogenous IAA microdroplet rescue experiments, or segmentation of the vendored Aeonium tabuliforme spiral rosette specimen. Overall 53.3/100 (faithfulness 50.5, reproducibility 59.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0cb0132; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 56, Morphological realism / specimen match 45, Parameter expressivity 51, Morphometric validation 52, Source and data traceability 68, Code-to-model traceability 58, Reproducibility package 54. Output judged: docs/media/auxin_pin1_phyllotaxis_comparison.png: rendered output of 2006-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem.py at 0cb0132, image/png, 55606 B, 1200×504 px, artifact_sha256 6b600014785b8ea36e7a34928c1ae7ce27f40434a97419b7a2ec2b96d1083969 (sha256 6b600014785b8ea36e7a34928c1ae7ce27f40434a97419b7a2ec2b96d1083969), spec_fingerprint 722bfcfebddd9b7a82c1bd7b9d04a028378c8556fe894a24ae273b6224593820. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 722bfcfebddd9b7a82c1bd7b9d04a028378c8556fe894a24ae273b6224593820; artifact_sha256: 6b600014785b8ea36e7a34928c1ae7ce27f40434a97419b7a2ec2b96d1083969; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/auxin_pin1_phyllotaxis/auxin_pin1_phyllotaxis_reference.json=96d4b539eaaf1649..., datasets/auxin_pin1_phyllotaxis/paper_citations.bib=9fe96650b32df64b..., datasets/auxin_pin1_phyllotaxis/rosette_phyllotaxis_specimen.jpg=ec50801b52dabc46..., datasets/auxin_pin1_phyllotaxis/scout_manifest.json=2e474ee5544f04f4...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Implement a 2D cellular L1 shoot apical meristem (SAM) dome + peripheral organogenic ring simulator with up-the-gradient Boltzmann PIN1 allocation P_ij = P_i exp(c_1 a_j) / sum_k exp(c_1 a_k), active + diffusive auxin transport, radial growth advection, and vascular sink depletion.",
        "remediation needed: Implement quantitative transitions across all 4 phyllotactic regimes of Smith et al. (2006) & Jönsson et al. (2006): Spiral Fibonacci (137.5 deg), Distichous alternate (180 deg), Decussate opposite pairs (90 deg), and Tricussate whorled triplets (120 deg), plus linear Turing-like instability dispersion analysis.",
        "remediation needed: Implement the Reinhardt et al. (2003) / Smith et al. (2006) perturbation experiments: NPA / pin1 polar transport block (T = 0 -> bare pin-formed apex with 0 primordia) and localized exogenous IAA lanolin microdroplet rescue (inducing a single primordium at phi_paste = 60 deg).",
        "remediation needed: Segment the vendored Aeonium tabuliforme spiral rosette specimen (`rosette_phyllotaxis_specimen.jpg`) to extract leaf primordia centroids, radial phyllotactic scaling, and Fibonacci parastichy spirals, with full SHA-256 verification and an 8-check `--self-test` suite." ;
    pk:hasScore 5.33e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
